DeepSeek Harness and npm dependencies
-------------------------------------

DSH Studio provisions the DeepSeek Harness runtime from upstream npm packages,
including `@deepseek-ai/dsh`, rather than relicensing or copying the upstream
project into this source tree. DeepSeek Harness and all npm dependencies remain
separate works under the licenses and notices supplied with their respective
distributions. The runtime lockfile records the resolved package versions and
license metadata; those licenses include MIT, Apache-2.0, BSD, ISC, and 0BSD.

No third-party dependency is included under the DSH Studio MIT License. Users
redistributing a provisioned runtime must preserve the applicable upstream
license notices.
